    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367840/extras/d4937cd5d37e0b8c0d8d32e7d6ed2a02.avif?t=1680895166\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Blazing Ace</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cI want to be stronger\u2026\u201d</h2>Summer bootcamp has begun!!! Let\u2019s make your dream come true!<br>Beast Fella Foundation (BFF), an organization which monitors martial arts competitions among beastmen, has sent you an invitation letter. An unforgettable summer memory ensues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Fight all the problems along with your teammates </u></i></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367840/extras/09146abd4c8613a9453d2f991c36f134.poster.avif?t=1680895166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367840/extras/09146abd4c8613a9453d2f991c36f134.webm?t=1680895166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367840/extras/09146abd4c8613a9453d2f991c36f134.mp4?t=1680895166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chikara</li></ul> Cheerful powerhouse of the Judo club who is always willing to solve (and create) problems, especially those that make your heart skipping a beat.<br>                  \t  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arato</li></ul> Advisor coach of the Judo club, who can certainly guide you into great career paths from his extensive experience, although he might need some guidance about his love life.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shirogami</li></ul> Junior champion of beastmen fights. Your childhood friend who shares the same dreams with you. Not a person who is good with words. Strong when becoming an ally, but even stronger when you are his enemy (!?) <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Taiyo</li></ul> Shirogami\u2019s best friend. Kind, warm, and super approachable. Another BFF participant who is always seen tagging along with Shirogami. What kind of strength does his small body hide?<br><br><i>Train hard. Sleep hard. And eat good food!!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin the legend of you and your friends!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visual Novel filled with sweat and dreams of young men. Appropriate for both kids and adults alike.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense fighting scenes using digital arts</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Martial arts dark secrets!?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple endings included.</li></ul>",
